  "kaon_0p305_update": "2026-07-18/19: the 0.305 GeV Ue/Umu points of the FONLL band, channel_breakdown, and decay_model_band were recomputed with the Pythia 8.315 + transport kaon model (0.305 is the only band mass <= the K->lN threshold). The FONLL ribbon at 0.305 is OMITTED (band_lo/hi = NaN) because at ~99.85% kaon dominance the member spread is acceptance-MC noise, not resolvable FONLL (see FONLL_MANIFEST.json partial_recomputes[0]; the low-mass systematic is kaon_desc_band.csv). All other masses and all Utau points are unchanged; the bundle is consistent with the republished central."
